### Orchestration Tips

{% if framework.orchestration_mode == 'simple' %}
- **Follow the rules** - Match keywords to agents explicitly
- **Update rules** - If new agents added, update orchestration rules in this file
- **Be predictable** - Same input should trigger same agents
{% elif framework.orchestration_mode == 'balanced' %}
- **Trust pattern matching** - Agent trigger patterns are comprehensive
- **Launch multiple agents** - Don't hesitate to use multiple agents for complex requests
- **Respect priorities** - High priority agents (security, planning) run first
- **Consider project type** - {{ project.type }} projects have specific agent needs
{% elif framework.orchestration_mode == 'tiered' %}
- **Use fast path when possible** - Don't over-coordinate simple tasks
- **Trust the coordinator** - It understands project context deeply
- **Provide coordinator context** - The more context, the better routing decisions
- **Review coordinator reasoning** - Coordinator explains its decisions
{% endif %}
- **Quality gates are mandatory** - Don't skip required reviews
- **Document with agents** - Use documentation agents, don't manually update docs
- **Use workflows for structure** - Workflows provide step-by-step guidance

